# Keep the working copy LF, not just the index.
#
# `core.autocrlf=true` is the Windows default, and under it a checkout rewrites
# every one of these files as CRLF — so the tree the tests run against would
# drift from the tree that was committed, and every diff would look like a
# whole-file rewrite. The repository is LF to begin with; this keeps it that way.
* text=auto eol=lf
